OL,3,AEsports World Cup ends with surprise
OL,4,Awin for China-based team
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina-based team AG.AL have been
OL,7,Fcrowned surprise winners of the Esports
OL,8,FWorld Cup (EWC) after seven weeks of
OL,9,Fcompetition in Paris.
OL,11,FThe team claimed the tournament trophy
OL,12,Fand $7m (#5.1m) top prize at a ceremony
OL,13,Fattended by French President Emmanuel
OL,14,FMacron, Saudi Crown Prince Mohammed Bin
OL,15,FSalman and Fifa boss Gianni Infantino.
OL,17,FBosses moved the contest, which was due
OL,18,Fto be held in Saudi Arabian capital
OL,19,FRiyadh, to France at the last minute
OL,20,Fdue to safety concerns over the
OL,21,Fconflict between the US and Iran in the
OL,22,FMiddle East.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
