OL,3,AEsports World Cup ends with surprise
OL,4,Awin for China-based team
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event has attracted criticism from
OL,7,Fsome fans due to Saudi Arabia's ongoing
OL,8,Finvolvement, but organisers the Esports
OL,9,FFoundation said it had attracted more
OL,10,Fviewers this year.
